.th ARCV I 7/14/75
.sh NAME
arcv \*- convert old archive files to new format
.sh SYNOPSIS
.bd arcv
file ...
.sh DESCRIPTION
.it Arcv
converts each file (assumed to be old archive format)
to the new format.
Each file is re-written.
.sh FILES
/tmp/arc#
.sh "SEE ALSO"
ar (I)
.sh DIAGNOSTICS
"not archive format" - file was not in old archive format.
.sh BUGS
